OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry start with some
OL,6,Fbrightness in the east. Showers will
OL,7,Fdevelop during the morning, merging
OL,8,Finto longer spells of rain through the
OL,9,Fafternoon, heavy in places. A chance
OL,10,Fof thunderstorms over Angus.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of heavy rain in
OL,13,Fthe evening will gradually ease but a
OL,14,Ffew light showers will continue
OL,15,Fovernight. Becoming breezy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA mainly cloudy and breezy
OL,18,Fmorning with the odd light shower over
OL,19,FAngus. Dry and bright in the afternoon
OL,20,Fwith winds becoming light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
